---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Compatibility tools" description="Free, private browser tools for checking compatibility, comparing products and calculating total technology ownership cost.">
	<section class="page-hero tools-hero">
		<div class="container page-hero-grid">
			<div><p class="eyebrow">Utility deck</p><h1>Tools that answer before you buy.</h1></div>
			<p class="lede">No account and no hidden ranking. Your inputs stay in your browser while verified evidence stays one click away.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="container tool-deck">
		<a class="deck-card deck-primary" href="/check/">
			<span class="deck-code">01 / MATCH</span>
			<div class="deck-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
			<h2>Compatibility checker</h2>
			<p>Turn your setup into ranked verdicts with blockers, limits and unknowns kept separate.</p>
			<span class="deck-action">Run the live video-doorbell checker →</span>
		</a>
		<a class="deck-card" href="/compare/">
			<span class="deck-code">02 / COMPARE</span>
			<div class="deck-icon" aria-hidden="true">⇄</div>
			<h2>Side-by-side compare</h2>
			<p>Compare the technical facts that change whether two products work in your setup.</p>
			<span class="deck-action">Open comparison →</span>
		</a>
		<a class="deck-card" href="/cost/">
			<span class="deck-code">03 / COST</span>
			<div class="deck-icon" aria-hidden="true">¤</div>
			<h2>True cost calculator</h2>
			<p>Use your own currency to include hardware, installation, extras and recurring plans.</p>
			<span class="deck-action">Calculate ownership cost →</span>
		</a>
		<a class="deck-card deck-passport" href="/passport/">
			<span class="deck-code">00 / PROFILE</span>
			<div class="deck-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div>
			<h2>Tech Passport</h2>
			<p>Save the country, platforms and connectors every future compatibility check should know.</p>
			<span class="deck-action">Create my passport →</span>
		</a>
	</section>

	<section class="section"><div class="container scope-notice"><strong>Current verified scope</strong><span>Smart home → Video doorbells</span><p>The tools framework is universal. Product verdicts only appear when the supporting category evidence is published.</p><a href="/categories/">See the coverage map →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
